users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-05T12:49:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T13:01:10Z","body":"\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/347cd63d-4000-4a57-87e3-9d1c3a8269da\" />\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82c2155e-47c8-4fda-a41c-ab24448920a1\" />\n\nThe above shows the Flame Graph with the dialog window kept in a tiled layout.\n\nSwitching the tiled dialog window to floating mode resolves the lag issue; After switching back to tile mode, there was still no lag.\n\nThe following shows the Flame Graph when the dialog window is first switched to floating mode, then switched to tiled mode and kept in that state.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d12256e6-854a-433c-bdd5-c4e6abe3bf51\" />\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13ac82ce-a9e1-487d-b6cf-ef21493e271c\" />\n\nThe difference between testing `run/platforms/linuxbsd/prefer_wayland` today and yesterday is likely that dialogs now open in floating mode.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/r